sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant ExtGW as Istio Gateway<br/>knative-ingress-gateway<br/>443/TCP TLS SIMPLE
    participant IntGW as Knative Local Gateway<br/>80/TCP -> 8081/TCP
    participant Predictor as caikit-tgis-serving<br/>Predictor Pod
    participant TGIS as TGIS Backend<br/>(in-process gRPC)
    participant S3 as MinIO / S3 Storage<br/>9000/TCP
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>(metrics scrape)
    participant MetricsSvc as Metrics Service<br/>8086/TCP

    Note over Client,S3: Inference Request Flow (External)
    Client->>ExtGW: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS SIMPLE (wildcard-certs)
    ExtGW->>Predictor: Route to predictor<br/>Internal HTTP
    Predictor->>TGIS: Text generation request<br/>In-process gRPC call
    TGIS-->>Predictor: Generated text response
    Predictor-->>ExtGW: Inference response
    ExtGW-->>Client: HTTPS response

    Note over IntGW,Predictor: Inference Request Flow (Internal)
    IntGW->>Predictor: HTTP/8081<br/>No TLS (internal)
    Predictor->>TGIS: Text generation request
    TGIS-->>Predictor: Generated text response
    Predictor-->>IntGW: Inference response

    Note over Predictor,S3: Model Loading Flow
    Predictor->>S3: Load model artifacts<br/>S3 API (storage-config secret)<br/>s3-usehttps=0 (demo config)
    S3-->>Predictor: Model files

    Note over Prometheus,MetricsSvc: Metrics Collection
    Prometheus->>MetricsSvc: GET /metrics<br/>8086/TCP<br/>kserve-prometheus-k8s RBAC
    MetricsSvc-->>Prometheus: Caikit inference metrics
